{"2070580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lord Ambermaze: Prologue", "steam_appid": 2070580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Test your wits and tactics in this stylish pixel-art maze where you’ll overcome predatory vegetables and stinky insects in unique turn-based challenges. Inspired by classic <i>Zelda</i> games, you’ll play as Zeyn, a young adventurer armed with a large sword, a bow, and bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   The gameplay is simple: time moves only when you move. Use this to your advantage — avoid deadly traps, lure enemies into them, plan several steps ahead, and use your modest arsenal to fend off the maze’s dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique one-off story that precedes the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exclusive boss not appearing in the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over thirty unique one-screen challenges filled with enemies, traps, and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning mode to challenge yourself and compare your results with players worldwide on the global leaderboard </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist the full game below!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070580/extras/7adcc4b1d45387b7bafd06ec7eee710e.apng?t=1768392203\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2070580/extras/7adcc4b1d45387b7bafd06ec7eee710e.poster.avif?t=1768392203\" class=\"bb_img\" width=106 height=188 /></picture></span>                                                  </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Test your wits and tactics in this stylish pixel-a